Patch Notes:
I. Desert Black Smoke, Evil Wolves in Pairs
  In the boundless depths of the desert, there is a pair of fierce wolves, they are demons of the desert, widely feared by merchants and travelers, their names spread throughout the sandy seas, one named Black Smoke, the other named White Wind.
  Visit NPC "Nanjiang" at the eastern post station to receive the quest!
  The initial difficulty of the Black Smoke Dread Wolf is level four; upon exiting the instance, it resets, making it immune to critical damage, and its wolf companion provides additional shielding!
  Black Smoke drops an extremely rare mount: Black Smoke Pup, covered in a light purple glow all over;
  Welcome all heroes to participate in the challenge!

II. Related Values
  A slight reduction in base damage for all monsters at difficulty level 3;
  Addition of 3 special blue equipment pieces: Ripple Shadow, Night Luoqi, Ding Zheng, obtainable from the Black Smoke Dread Wolf;
  The crit damage increase effect from "Burial Guard Bracers" has been reduced by 20%;
  The energy recovery from "Taiwu Transformation Bracers" by Yuwen Jingzhe has been changed to skill cooldown;

III. Partial Bugs
  Fixed a bug where some players, after completing the Nanjuanzi quest, couldn't correctly refresh Nanjuanzi;
  Fixed a bug where some players couldn't complete the final step of the Thief series quest;
  Fixed a bug where some players, after defeating the South Departure Fire Lord in the Fire Temple, couldn't correctly refresh the instance teleportation gate;
  The Thirsty Sandman equipment's global magic damage enhancement now includes shadow damage;
Buff-induced cooldown reduction (cdr) now correctly affects the increased damage to the Five Golden Men;
  Cooldown acceleration can now be correctly displayed on the panel;
  Modified descriptions for several commandments' buffs;
  Slightly increased drop rates for green equipment.

Update Content:

I. Yuwen Skills
	Added Yuwen Jīngzhé's second set of equipment — the Jade Cultivation Golden Immortal Set:
	Shan Fairy's Condensed Cap, Jade Cultivation Fairy Robe, Yangcai Wrist Turtle Armguards, Golden Immortal's Kongtong Sword;
	Dropped respectively by bosses Di Hufa Hou Xiaoman, Thunder Dragon, Leopard Taro, Purple Poison Spider Mother;
	Slight adjustments to Tianlong's Five Pinnacles skills, increasing damage and reducing cooldown;
	Some adjustments to Yuwen Jīngzhé's talents;

II. Magic Contract Drops
	Drops from Leopard Taro, Hou Xiaoman:
	Yuwen Jīngzhé's Jade Cultivation Fairy, Golden Immortal Five Pinnacles Magic Contracts;
	Mangzi's North Sea Dragon Lady, North Sea Witch's Magic Contracts;

III. Sound Effect Restoration
	Game battle sound effects are currently being enhanced;
	Comprehensive enhancement of all of Mangzi's skills and summoned creature sound effects;

Update Content:

[h1]I. Mangzi Skills[/h1]
	New ultimate skill for Mangzi: Bashan Thunder Spirit Concubine
	Added Mangzi's second set of equipment - North Sea Enchantress Set:
	North Sea Dragon King's Cold Jade Hairpin, North Sea Witch's Ice Silkworm Robe, North Ming Kun Belt, Frigid Ice Wheel
	Dropped respectively by bosses such as Hou Xiaoman, Thunderous Dragon of Clouds, Aozhen, Leopard Taro, and Awakening Strange Stone
	Significantly enhanced skills such as Jade-Faced Guardian Palace, Bashan Thunder Spirit Concubine, etc.!
	The cooldown time for skills such as Shadow-winged mantis, Flying bats in the forest, The fire swarm, The fallen sheep has been greatly reduced.
	The damage of Flower butterfly's every jump time is slightly extended, changed from 0.5 seconds to 0.66 seconds;

[h1]II. Remote Repair[/h1]
	Fixed the problem of incomplete alignment between the direction of remote skills and the direction of the mouse;
	Fixed the issue where remote sub-objects could possibly be in the enemy;
	When using the mouse, releasing remote skills will no longer have automatic aiming with turning;
	All monsters have added a frozen frame action;

[h1]III. Other Numerical Values[/h1]
	Fixed the bug that may cause the last few pages of the warehouse to get stuck;
	Fixed the bug where the skill level did not respond promptly when replacing equipment with skill enhancement;
	Fixed the bug where talents in the same level would ignore talent prerequisites when reducing talent levels;
	Weakened Gaochang King, reducing the healing ability of Gaochang King's blood spirit minions and reducing their health;
	Weakened Thunder Dragon, no longer invincible throughout, changed to invincible when releasing skills;
	Slightly adjusted the levels of the Tian Shan's fourth floor;

[h1]IV. Text Fixes[/h1]
	Scenes temporarily not opened have modified scene entrance effects and added construction in progress prompts;
	Fixed the bug where some follower avatars could not be displayed;
	Fixed the incorrect prompt to return to the inn to rest after completing the mainline task of Ghost General;
	Fixed the description error of Stone Ban Dao Ren's Fire Spirit task;
	Fixed some errors in the names of Potency, Magic Pact, etc.;
	Fixed the incorrect buff icon and description of bosses like Hou Xiaoman, Chi Yang;
	Fixed the name bug of Hou Xiaoman;

[h1]V. Other Content[/h1]
	Currently making the Crystal Palace map of the Crescent Spring, added underwater shader and corresponding models, stay tuned;

Steam official version v1.1.15e - 20240316  

Minor fixes:  
1. Hu Yi in Moon Crescent City now sells gourds;  
2. Li Shan and in Kunlun Mountains now sell Kunlun white horses;  
3. Nan Juanzi in River Valley now sells some candies.

Update Content:

1. Travel Handbook
The travel notes have added 60 small tasks, completing them can help you understand various operations and improve skills in the game;
At the same time, each profession's travel notes have added a professional set and a brown horse mount;
Can't defeat the King of Gaochang? Don't know what to do after reaching max level? Don't know how to improve your strength?
This is a very important feature for friends who have not joined our community!

2. New Magic Contract:
Added Gu Qingming's super skill magic contract Phantom Moluo, changing the effects of Snowflake Six and Faxiang Extending;
Added Mangzi's super skill magic contract Witch Mountain Goddess, greatly improving the ability of the Moon Blade Hand;
You can obtain a set with this magic contract through the travel notes, or you can go to Yueya City to buy it directly from Li Zheng.

3. Visual Effects
The vast majority of scenes such as Yuhang Palace, Yuxu Palace, Kunlun Mountain Gate, East City Desert, West City Desert, Valley, Tianhuo Mountain, and Guiaoling have rich resources added;
Added many scene resources and scene effects, and adjusted all scene lighting;
The loading scenery photos of all scenes are remade to match the optimized graphics of the scenes.

4. Other Values
The CD of Fairy Bite has been increased by 1 second;
Fixed the bug of Snowflake Six skill damage attribute error;
The Zhujian Cave scene has been restructured, and monster and route optimization has been carried out to avoid getting lost;
Fixed the bug that it was difficult to deliver the Yushi task of Yin Gongzi.

Urgent fixes for 3 minor bugs:
(1) Bug where the back door from Mingyue Inn to Yueya City was closed;
(2) Bug where the portal closed after Yuwen Xu Zhang meditated and left;
(3) Bug where the portal closed after the end of the Dongping demon extermination.

What's New:
1. the loss rate is modified
During the upgrade process, the loss rate of orange equipment is greatly increased (about 1.5 times);
The loss rate of advanced precious equipment dropped in the world has increased significantly (about 1.5 times);
Drop chance of stones 1 to 12 increased by 12.5%

2. bug modification
When the character passes through the jump point, the pet will follow along with the transfer, to prevent the scene such as the Buddha worship place, the summoning object lost bug;
Fixed a bug where the character's pet moved when interacting with items such as boxes, causing the interface to close;
Modified the release distance of Manzi's Summon ability to 8 meters by default, and can be forced to release the ability without using shift key when releasing;
Fixed a bug where the death of the current character could send an error when switching character archives.
Fixed the bug that when defeating the Spirit of the Four Yuan King, the boss's death was not recorded in the map, and the advanced drop of the orange treasure chest of the Spirit of the Four Yuan King did not drop;
Fixed a bug in West Gobi where the discarded item "Light Opener" was dropped from the bag, and changed to "Book of the Magic Eye".
